  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable and Integrated Landscape Management of the Western Area Peninsula</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to address these barriers by means of four integrated impact pathways: 1. Enhancement of systematic and institutional capacity for integrated landscape management; 2. Demonstration of sustainable land management interventions; 3. Facilitation of increased financial flows to support integrated land management and protected area management; 4. Mainstreaming of monitoring and evaluation, knowledge management and gender issues to support lesson learning, sustainability and upscaling</narrative>
  </description>
